  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Networking within MAB and the WNBR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In addition to regional networks, there are many thematic networks which need to be reinforced by the establishment and functioning process. In this regard and with the view of supporting Water related issues in BRs, the MAB programme and IHP will partner through Ecohydrology thematic. Beside thematic networks, the MAB Secretariat shall also promote and strengthen participation of MAB Youth in the programme. MAB Young Scientists Awards (YSA) have been granted for more than 30 years. Results of these studies will be shared to improve the WNBR and enhance the role of biosphere reserves in biodiversity conservation, ecosystem restoration, and climate change mitigation.</narrative>
  </description>
